  "title": "Paris Air Show: TotalEnergies Signs a Deal with Quatra to Secure Feedstock for its Biorefineries",
  "summary": "Paris, June 17, 2025 – TotalEnergies and Quatra, the European market leader in the collection and recycling of used cooking oil, have signed a 15-year agreement beginning in 2026, for the supply of 60,000 tons a year of European used cooking oil to TotalEnergies’ biorefineries. This deal contributes to secure the feedstock to produce biodiesel […]",
